gy, his eyes are dark,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l015","ordinal":301285,"en":"There is no such thing in a person."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l016","ordinal":301286,"en":"Diaper mouth, half eyelid,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l017","ordinal":301287,"en":"Hungry lion breasted,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l018","ordinal":301288,"en":"Algyr is intended"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l019","ordinal":301289,"en":"Itching in both eyes"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l020","ordinal":301290,"en":"Like a dry lake,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l021","ordinal":301291,"en":"A century in motion"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l022","ordinal":301292,"en":"Like swallowing instead of doing."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l023","ordinal":301293,"en":"A strand of his mustache"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l024","ordinal":301294,"en":"Like a greasy ax handle,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l025","ordinal":301295,"en":"Twisted mustache"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l026","ordinal":301296,"en":"Like the hay of Bukhara."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l027","ordinal":301297,"en":"The words that came out of his mouth,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l028","ordinal":301298,"en":"Middle waist like umbilical cord."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l029","ordinal":301299,"en":"At least human"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l030","ordinal":301300,"en":"It's like eating without stopping."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l031","ordinal":301301,"en":"Your late grandfather -"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l032","ordinal":301302,"en":"Riverine tribes"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l033","ordinal":301303,"en":"He was a man like Chatkal."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l034","ordinal":301304,"en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l035","ordinal":301305,"en":"He was a man like mud."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l036","ordinal":301306,"en":"Aiza stretched out her hand,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0082:b003:l037","ordinal":301307,"en":"Your father is a hero."},{